# MERCHANT TRADE GRID (screen 0x0c) — playthrough-driven port, session 27.
# Extends merchant_click.jsonl: after the merchant county-interior opens
# (castle click), click a GOOD zone on the market rug -> the trade grid
# (engine_trade.c, port of FUN_00416308/428daf/41635f).  The zone hit-test
# (FUN_004357a6 -> engine_merchant_zone_at) indexes mercgrid.pl8's 80x60
# goods map at (cursor>>3); a click on a rug good sets DAT_0056d8ac + flips
# to screen 0x0c.  Then RMB closes back to the merchant (screen 8), and a
# second RMB closes to the map.
#
# Castle cell (260,250) = the player's own castle (county 3 "Lancashire").
# Grain zone centroid = pixel (212,340) -> lparam 212 + 340*65536 = 22282452
# (mercgrid.pl8 value 1 = Grain; matches --force-trade 1).
#
# Load prefix copied verbatim from merchant_click.jsonl (menu -> load
# lastturn).  See project_playthrough_porting + docs/findings/gameplay-and-screens.
